@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+# Rollback
+
+To revert the Knowledge pack boundary without changing the database:
+
+1. Move files from `packs/knowledge/app/` back to the root `app/` tree (models, services, controllers, public API).
+2. Remove `packs/knowledge/` and drop `packs/knowledge` from root `package.yml` dependencies.
+3. Run `bundle exec ruby -rstringio -S packwerk validate` and `bundle exec ruby -rstringio -S packwerk check`.
+4. Run `bundle exec ruby test/visible_test.rb`.
+
+No migration rollback is required; tables and records are unchanged.
